  "fullDescription": "Sweeten up your creative projects with this ultra-adorable collection of 50 unique kawaii bakery and cake sticker illustrations! Designed in a clean, flat vector style with bold outlines and expressive smiling faces, this set includes birthday cakes, layered slices, cupcakes, macarons, donuts, croissants, baguettes, pies, and baking accessories. Rendered in a warm pastel palette of strawberry red, cream, soft pink, and chocolate brown, these friendly characters bring instant charm to any design.\nEach illustration is isolated on a transparent/white background for quick and effortless editing. Perfect for junk journals, planners, scrapbooking, DIY crafts, digital stickers, branding, and commercial product design!\nWhat’s Included in the Download:\n50 High-Resolution PNG Files (Transparent Background)\n50 JPG Files (High Quality on Crisp White Background)\n50 EPS Files (Scalable Vector Format)\n50 SVG Files (Vector Format for Cutting Machines & Digital Use)\n6 Extra Bonus Gift Illustrations 🎁\nMaster Editable Adobe Illustrator (.AI) File (Fully customizable colors & vectors)\nAdd this sweet, versatile clipart collection to your toolkit today and bring joy to your creative designs!",
